---
title: "publishRaisedCapital (LegionPreLiquidApprovedSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_guard: onlyLegion AND whenNotPaused AND whenSaleEnded AND whenSaleNotCanceled AND whenRefundPeriodIsOver
    q_guard --> q_verify: guards pass
    q_verify --> q_revert: totalCapitalRaised != 0
    q_revert --> [*]: revert LegionSale__CapitalRaisedAlreadyPublished()
    q_verify --> q_set: totalCapitalRaised == 0
    q_set --> q_emit: totalCapitalRaised = capitalRaised
    q_emit --> [*]: emit CapitalRaisedPublished(capitalRaised)

    note right of q_set
        INV-001: capital raised can only be published once
        INV-002: only Legion can set the raised capital amount
        INV-003: must be after sale ended and refund period over
    end note
